message: >-
  If you use M2Lean, please cite this software record and the accompanying
  paper when its architecture or case studies are relevant.
type: software
title: "M2Lean: certificate-based interoperability between Macaulay2 and Lean 4"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-03
authors:
  - family-names: Tawfeek
    given-names: Andrew
