repository-code: "https://github.com/andrew-tawfeek/M2Lean"
url: "https://github.com/andrew-tawfeek/M2Lean"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Macaulay2
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - computer algebra
  - certificates
  - Gröbner bases
abstract: >-
  M2Lean transports explicit evidence from untrusted Macaulay2 computations
  to executable Lean checkers and, for selected claim families, to
  kernel-checked mathematical theorems.
